### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn FastAPI",
  "description": "Build and test a REST API",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2027-01-15"
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks?status=todo&limit=10

### Update a task (replace 1 with a real ID)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "done"}

### Task statistics
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/stats

### Delete a task (replace 1 with a real ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
